---
title: "truespeech — DLL and WAV Lifecycle"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Application
  participant ABI as DLL ABI
  participant State as TrueSpeechContext
  participant WAV as wav.rs
  App->>ABI: TrueSpeech_Init(format)
  ABI->>State: Create encoder state
  App->>ABI: TrueSpeech_Encod(240 PCM samples)
  ABI->>State: encode_frame
  State-->>ABI: 32-byte packet
  ABI-->>App: status + packet
  App->>ABI: TrueSpeech_Reset when needed
  App->>ABI: TrueSpeech_Term when finished
  App->>WAV: write_truespeech_wav(samples)
  WAV->>State: Encode consecutive frames
  WAV->>WAV: pad partial frame + flush delay
  WAV-->>App: RIFF / fmt / fact / data
